  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0087_57a6ee618086.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 139px;\" /></p><p>Initially, the centre of mass of the right column will be at height of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;and the centre of mass of the left column will be at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. After opening of the valve both columns will have height of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>125</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;and their centre of mass will be at height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>125</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>.&nbsp;Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>g</mi><mfrac><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>g</mi><mfrac><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>Putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>,&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
